OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after armed police
OL,4,Araid on house
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed police have arrested three people
OL,7,Fin connection with firearms offences.
OL,9,FPlain-clothes officers from
OL,10,FLincolnshire Police raided a house on
OL,11,FAsquith Street, Gainsborough, on
OL,12,FThursday and detained two 24-year-old
OL,13,Fmen on suspicion of possessing a
OL,14,Ffirearm with intent to endanger life.
OL,16,FArmed police later arrested a
OL,17,F22-year-old man on Theaker Avenue in
OL,18,Fthe town on suspicion of possessing a
OL,19,Ffirearm with intent to endanger life
OL,20,Fand possessing a firearm without a
OL,21,Fcertificate.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
