OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after armed police
OL,4,Araid on house
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the operation had
OL,7,F"generated a significant number of
OL,8,Fcalls from concerned residents and,
OL,9,Funfortunately, led to misinformation
OL,10,Fbeing circulated on social media".
